                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَامِيَةٌ</span></b> 
                        , of a grape-vine, The <i>shoot upon which
are the bunches of grapes:</i> (M, K:) or the <i>eye,</i>
or <i>bud, that breaks open so as to disclose its
leaves and its berries:</i> (M:) or <i>its branches:</i>
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَامٍ</span>. (T.)

